.svelte-kit
build
node_modules
pnpm-lock.yaml
# Generated from the backend's OpenAPI document; never hand-edited, so never
# reformatted either.
src/lib/api/generated

# Compiled from messages/*.json by the Paraglide Vite plugin.
src/lib/paraglide

# Paraglide owns this folder. It regenerates the cache, a .meta.json and a
# README on every `pnpm messages`, and git ignores all three
# (project.inlang/.gitignore keeps only settings.json). Formatting generated
# files nobody commits just broke `make lint` on a fresh clone.
project.inlang/*
!project.inlang/settings.json
